msgid "The GPU node was not removed because GPU records belong to it. Disable it instead; GPU records are never deleted."
msgstr "Hindi tinanggal ang GPU node dahil may mga tala ng GPU na nakaugnay dito. I-disable na lamang ito; hindi kailanman tinatanggal ang mga tala ng GPU."

#: gpu_nodes.php
msgid "The GPU now belongs to the node it was seen at, with its history."
msgstr "Ang GPU ay pagmamay-ari na ngayon ng node kung saan ito nakita, kasama ang kasaysayan nito."

